her husband are his real parents.

224
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,030
Wow.

225
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:26,540
Mom, I was wondering. About what?

226
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:30,457
I guess about the way he's
been since middle school.

227
00:18:30,540 --> 00:18:33,697
He'd go into his room and
play games online for hours.

228
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:36,497
You think it's because he found
out about his real parents?

229
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:37,660
No, not at all.

230
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:40,437
He was always into
computers and technology.

231
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:44,777
By the time he was six, he'd already
built his own computer out of spare parts.

232
00:18:44,860 --> 00:18:48,957
If anything, he's like that because
he's a huge computer nerd like me.

233
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:50,400
Or so he thinks.

234
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:55,228
Well, I'm heading home
and get dinner ready.

235
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:57,860
Don't stay too long, okay, Suguha?

236
00:18:58,460 --> 00:19:00,220
Don't worry. I won't.

237
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:06,960
Happy birthday, kiddo.

238
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:18,140
He's my cousin, not my big brother.

239
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:21,120
I still have a hard time believing it.

240
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:25,840
My big brother.

241
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:56,600
But, in the end, your heart?

242
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,980
In the end, your heart!

243
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,740
Belongs to her.

244
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:20,600
Come on.

245
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,057
Wake up, Sugu.

246
00:20:22,140 --> 00:20:23,040
It's morning.

247
